	<section_number>38.2-4202</section_number>
	<catch_line>Hospital services plans</catch_line>
	<text>
		A hospital or a group of hospitals may conduct through a nonstock corporation as agent for them a hospital services plan as defined in § 38.2-4201.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 32-195.1; 1956, c. 268, § 38.1-810; 1960, c. 357; 1979, c. 721; 1980, c. 682; 1986, c. 562.</history>
